  abilityDesc: 20 combo Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), 5 combo Thunder attack on single foe (25% active Pierce on Water/Thunder
    foes), boosts Atk, Def relative to max HP for 4 turns, boosts spark damage for
    4 turns, boosts Atk, Def for 4 turns & boosts critical damage for 4 turns
